EVALUATION.md §1, CODEGEN.md §4.2, §5.3: baked gen/go refuses a table field of the record of a public table value, whose id enum holds that table's keys (TableField); a table value is its container, not a table field.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A cell.
record Cell {
  /// Its value.
  v: Int
}

/// A row.
record Row {
  /// The cells.
  cells: table Cell
}

/// The cells, fine.
let cells: table Cell = {
  c1 { v: 1 }
}

emit go { out: "@features/a", package: "a" }
-- a.cells.json --
{"c1": {"v": 1}}
-- findings.txt --
error[E8019]  a/a.canon:12:3
  emit go in baked mode cannot generate a table field; hold it in a keyed list

